<table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Dec 29, 2003 :: Weekend updates</div><P>Let's see, kind of quiet around here with the holidays. Mabh led some folks to take down some of her epic mobs. A few of us headed into Sleepers still hoping for Mahrsan's fistwraps, but still no luck there.. Grats Meeka on an ancient prismatic staff!</P>
<P>Killed the Dain twice, grats Reide and Aridius on Dain's head, Leviathaun and Perragon on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics17/Frostreaver.jpg">Frostreaver</A>, Ccra on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/rpics/frostreavers_embroidered_cloak.jpg">Frostreaver's Embroidered Cloak</A>, Tristastar on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/Ring_of_Winter.jpg">Ring of Winter</A>, Perragon on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=6736">Aegis of Ice</A>! Papajay saved <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/frostreavers_velium_crown.jpg">Frostreaver's Velium Crown</A> from rotting and a couple Ring of Winter and Shield of the Seneschals went to Greed!</P>
<P>Did the Ring War for Raihndance as well! Grats on your <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/ring_dain_frostweaver.jpg">Ring of Dain Frostreaver IV</A>, Morlith on your <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/rpics/crown_of_narandi.jpg">Crown of Narandi</A>, Kahln on your <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/Choker_of_the_Wretched.jpg">Choker of the Wretched</A>, Saragoth on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/narandis_lance.jpg">Narandi's Lance</A>, Wellish on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/earringfrozenskull.jpg">Earring of the Frozen Skull</A>! <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=6893">Faceguard of Bentos the Hero</A> and <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=6789">Eye of Narandi</A> went to some Greed roll winners. </P>
<P>Leveling grats!<BR>Grats Mytee on 64!<BR>Grats Sparkley and Softeyes on 61!<BR>Grats Perragon and 57!<BR>Grats Tidark on 55 and Myrmidon!<BR>Leviathaun 54th!<BR>Grats Mabh on 55!<BR>Dalorm 53rd!<BR>Grats Thiia on 41!<BR>Fopu 30th!<BR></P>
<P>&nbsp;</P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Wonderous on Dec 29, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Dec 22, 2003 :: Grats Anarandil on 65!!</div><P>Grats to the newest 65 paladin, Anarandil! <BR>I know others have leveled, and I'll add those later. I think I made level updates Wonderous' job anyways.. /smirks</P>
<P>Wonderous led folks into ToV for some hunting, and I heard a few nice drops being said, but I wasn't there so I'm a bit lost at giving an update. So I'll have to make some stuff up. .. erm.. Grats Wonderous on your full set of chain! Grats Bery on some silk boxers for the holiday! Grats Morlith on your death, I'm sure! /nods</P>
<P>..... Wonderous wanders in .....</P>
<P>Oh yes.. the raid.. we had a gorgeous Chain Breastplate head to MQ-Land, a Plate Bracer that headed over to Morlith's grasping hands and some Plate Arms that looked quite fetching on Duktak's arms /whistle!</P>
<P>Now if I just remember to take attendance ;)</P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Wonderous on Dec 23, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Dec 21, 2003 :: Patches are evil</div><P>However, we got to kill MotG twice with the servers crashing on Friday! Sure, it was real exciting to have everyone log back on at his feet the second time, but can't beat killing him twice!</P>
<P>Some late grats on leveling..<BR><BR>Grats Zorin on 60 and High Priest!<BR>Grats Mytee on 63!<BR>Grats Wellish on 57!</P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Dec 18, 2003 :: Mujaki Devoured</div><P>Despite the servers eating our MT and SA during the fight and them unable to log back on, we killed him. Grats Dorina on your earring, Edenstar on your cloak, and I got booted before rolling off the other loot we got on the way there. Will update this later!</P>
<P>Grats Yimish on 65 and Overlord!<BR>Grats Lumalie on 61!<BR>Um... know I forgot more...</P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Dec 15, 2003 :: Arglar named King of the Dwarves.. </div><P>Well, maybe not, but Arglar got his big war! Okies, this update is late, but it's only Arg.. </P>
<P>Thanks folks for coming out to the Great Divide to do Arglar's Ring War. Looks like 23 of us started this little war, and we were kept quite busy! Everyone worked harder than ever and of course we succeeded! </P>
<P>Grats Arglar on your ring, Shatta on your choker, Morlith on the faceguard and hell must of frozen over because Vorne finally won the Crown of Narandi! Sadly for us, it has no graphic so we're forced to look at his ugly mug. I forget who won the greed rolls on the lance, earring, and eye. </P>
<P>Some leveling updates!<BR>Grats Yimmah on 64! <BR>Grats Tryder and Bashiuss on 63! <BR>Grats Kasiryn on 62!<BR>Grats Aelfric on 59!<BR>Grats Shatta on 52!<BR>Grats Hedonista on 47!</P>
<P>Hopefully didn't miss anyone!</P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Dec 16, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Dec 13, 2003 :: Gnews!!</div><P align=center><FONT color=#0000ff size=1>Grats Thayet on 65 and Arch Convoker!!! Muhahha</FONT></P>
<P align=left><FONT color=#ffffff size=2>Grats Aridius on 65 and Maestro!<BR>Grats Anarandil on 64!<BR>Grats Cimerene on 63!<BR>Grats Mytee on 62!<BR>Grats Kasiryn on 61!<BR>Grats Lumalie on 60 and Phantasmist!<BR>Grats Edenstar on 55 and Beguiler!<BR>Grats Leviathaun on 52!<BR>Grats Shatta on 51 and Vicar!</FONT></P>
<P align=left><FONT color=#ffffff size=2>Grats Neola on your shissar snakey epic!! Will have to sneak into the Nexus and get a picture, or put the dwarf on the job!</FONT></P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Wonderous on Dec 17, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Dec 10, 2003 :: Hail to the King, baby.. </div><IMG alt="" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/kingkazon.jpg" align=baseline border=0><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Dec 9, 2003 :: Arglar made Marshall! </div><P>Not recently, but I forgot to mention it and had to talk him back from the edge of a building due to it. So, this post is for the little guy!</P>
<P><IMG alt="Look ma! A Marshall! Not a crappy Veteran!" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/argmarshall.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P>
<P>Killed the trash pile tonight for a few more flags and some fun! Juhel kindly split up the mobs for mezzing to make the chanter's job easier, and Balut went linkdead at the start of fights. Good stuff! </P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Dec 10, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><span class="page-scroll">Pages: <a href='news.asp?page=6'>&laquo;</a>&nbsp;<a href='news.asp?page=1'>1</a>...<a href='news.asp?page=5'>5</a> <a href='news.asp?page=6'>6</a> 7 <a href='news.asp?page=8'>8</a> <a href='news.asp?page=9'>9</a>...<a href='news.asp?page=15'>15</a>&nbsp;<a href='news.asp?page=8'>&raquo;</a></span></td>
			<td class="panel-cell"><!-- Right Panel Cell -->
				<div class="headlines">
<a href=news.asp?newsid=620><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/manaetic_behemoth.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Mar 26</b></a> - Manetic Behemoth and Cap!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=612><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/althumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Feb 29</b></a> - Flawless Victory!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=611><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/adthumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Feb 28</b></a> - Aerin'Dar, dragon o' pally loot!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=605><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/grummthumb.gif border=0 width=125><br><b>Feb 1</b></a> - I'm bigger than you.. I'm higher on the food chain!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=602><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/littleterry.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Jan 24</b></a> - Terris Thule Naptime!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=575><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/dainthumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Nov 22</b></a> - Dain Frostreaver's Feet!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=563><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/yelinak.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Nov 8</b></a> - Lord Yelinak!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=562><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/stthumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Nov 7</b></a> - Visit to Sleeper's Tomb<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=560><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/tormaxthumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Nov 5</b></a> - The King is Dead!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=547><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/vpthumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Oct 26</b></a> - Veeshan's Peak cleared!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=543><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/narandithumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Oct 21</b></a> - Mahrsan gets his 10th Ring, and we get to have a war!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=542><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/lendthumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Oct 18</b></a> - Keep this, beotch! And Sont too..<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=524><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/zlandthumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Oct 3</b></a> - Zland and Kland go down... naughty..<p>
